### MaterialRates — UPDATE PATCH, partial update (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/material-rates/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pricePerKg": 1300
}

### MaterialRates — PATCH status active re-activates a history rate (expects 200 OK; previousRatesClosed = 1)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/material-rates/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}
